---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
---

<div class="container">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Whispers</h1>
    <p>Anonymous encrypted file storage for personal use.</p>
    <p>No account is required. Your browser generates and stores the decryption key locally, and the server receives only encrypted data and metadata.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="panel">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <ol class="step-list">
      <li>Select a file from your device.</li>
      <li>Your browser encrypts it before it leaves your device.</li>
      <li>The server stores only the encrypted payload and metadata.</li>
      <li>You can later retrieve and decrypt the file locally in the browser.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section class="panel notice">
    <strong>Important:</strong> Your decryption key remains in this browser unless you explicitly share it with another user. If you clear browser storage or lose the key, your encrypted files cannot be decrypted again.
  </section>

  <div class="grid">
    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Manage your decryption key</h2>
      <p>The key stays in your browser and is never sent to the server. Copy it to share access with another user, or paste a shared key here to decrypt files from that browser.</p>
      <label class="inline-label" for="keyValue">Current decryption key</label>
      <textarea id="keyValue" rows="4" readonly></textarea>
      <div class="key-actions">
        <button id="copyKeyButton" type="button">Copy key</button>
      </div>
      <label class="inline-label" for="importKeyInput">Paste a shared key</label>
      <textarea id="importKeyInput" rows="4" placeholder="Paste the decryption key shared by another user"></textarea>
      <button id="importKeyButton" type="button">Import key</button>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Upload a file</h2>
      <p>Select a local file. It will be encrypted in your browser before it is sent. You can also set an optional expiration date.</p>
      <label class="inline-label" for="expirationDate">Optional expiration date</label>
      <input id="expirationDate" type="date">
      <input id="fileInput" class="hidden" type="file">
      <label for="fileInput" class="file-picker">Choose file</label>
      <button id="uploadButton" type="button">Upload encrypted file</button>
      <div id="uploadResult" class="message">Waiting for a file.</div>
    </section>

    <section class="panel">
      <h2>Your stored files</h2>
      <p id="state">Preparing your browser key…</p>
      <div id="storageList" class="file-list"></div>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="panel hidden" id="downloadPane">
    <h2>Download a file</h2>
    <div class="status-card">
      <strong id="downloadTitle">Select a file</strong>
      <div id="downloadMeta">Choose an entry from the list to decrypt it locally.</div>
    </div>
    <button id="downloadButton" type="button">Download and decrypt</button>
  </section>
</div>
